   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="address">
            <address>
               <addrLine>
                  <pb facs="HS1985.1.2568_0001" />D<hi rend="superscript">r</hi> Artur
                  Schnitzler</addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs ref="#pmb68" type="place">Wien XVIII</rs>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs ref="#pmb168940" type="place">Spöttelgasse 7</rs>
               </addrLine>
            </address>
         </div>
         <div type="image">
            <p rend="center">
               <pb facs="HS1985.1.2568_0002" />
               <hi rend="pre-print">
                  <rs ref="#pmb1133" type="place">Zürich – Rotes Schloss</rs> und <rs ref="#pmb1134" type="place">Tonhalle</rs>
               </hi>
            </p>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <lg type="poem">
               <l>
                  <pb facs="HS1985.1.2568_0001" />
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb5489" />Von Bahr vernahmen das Dilemma</l>
               <l>Wir eben zwischen <rs type="work" ref="#pmb29833" subtype="implied">Franz</rs> u
                     <rs ref="#pmb29833" type="work" subtype="implied">Emma</rs>
               </l>
               <l>Ja es ist bitter, wenn die »<rs ref="#pmb29833" type="work">Toten
                  schweigen</rs>«</l>
               <l>Doch jetzt, in frohem, lust’gem »<rs type="work" ref="#pmb29855" subtype="implied">Reigen</rs>« </l>
               <l>Von guter Speis’ u Trank ganz voll</l>
               <l>Gedenken wir des »<rs ref="#pmb29935" type="work">Anatol</rs>«</l>
               <l>Und wünschen sehnlich ihn herbei</l>
               <l>Das gäb’ ne nette »<rs ref="#pmb29917" type="work">Liebelei</rs>«</l>
               <l>Und mit dem »<rs ref="#pmb29843" type="work">grünen Kakadu</rs>«</l>
               <l>Wär’n wir gar balde Du und Du!!</l>
            </lg>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="2">
            <p>
               <handShift scribe="#pmb10815" />
               <anchor type="textConst" xml:id="T_L01799-1" />Herzlich <signed>Hermann</signed>
               <note type="textConst" corresp="T_L01799-1">in der oberen linken Ecke, verkehrt zum
                  Text</note>
            </p>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="3">
            <p>
               <pb facs="HS1985.1.2568_0002" />
               <handShift scribe="#pmb10977" />Vom Schnitzler-Abend, den uns Herma<c rendition="#gemination-n" /> Bahr bot, senden wir Ihnen herzliche Grüsse:</p>
            <p>
               <signed>Hans Bodmer</signed>
            </p>
            <p>
               <signed>
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb29122" />EProbst</signed>
            </p>
            <p>
               <signed>
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb29123" />R. Probst</signed>
            </p>
            <p>
               <signed>
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb29120" />Sepp Staehelin</signed>
            </p>
            <p>
               <signed>
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb29126" />R. W. Huber.</signed>
            </p>
            <p>
               <signed>
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb28344" />Gertrud Staehelin-Baechtold.</signed>
            </p>
            <p>
               <signed>
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb11913" />Hermann Kesser</signed>
            </p>
            <p>
               <signed>
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb29124" />Mathilde Bodmer</signed>
            </p>
            <p>
               <signed>
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb5489" />Hermann Bodmer</signed>
            </p>
            <p>
               <signed>
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb5490" />Emanuel von Bodman</signed>
            </p>
            <p>
               <signed>
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb5495" />Spyridon Sartoris</signed>
            </p>
            <p>
               <signed>
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb29121" />M. Sartoris.</signed>
            </p>
         </div>
